As an HRD I'm:
Building and transforming HR strategy and processes to support the business through its fast growth stage;
Work closely in cooperation with the company's management to scale the business up and achieve strategic goals;
Composing and implementing the Company's procedures and other regulations;
Developing the company's HR brand and providing its awareness among employees and candidates;
Building L&D strategy based on organizational competencies and business needs;
Launching and implementing the Total Reward System (compensation, benefits, reward, work-life balance, career growth);
Analyzing and making decisions based on HR and business data;
Leading the team above 20 people (recruitment, people ops., L&D, C&B, employer brand, HR admin team, office admin team)
Experienced in various HRIS (Hibob, Jobvite, Notion, Jira, BambooHR, etc.);
Experienced in M&A projects.
I'm interested in companies with a forward-thinking environment. I am ready to discuss the following roles: HRD / Head of HR department / Vice President of People in a fast-growing company. My salary expectations are negotiable based on job responsibilities, the overall compensation package, and advanced opportunities.

