Copywriter, content writer

Moreinfo:
IT Copywriter with 2+ years of experience writing compelling cross-channel copy for blogs, social networks, and the web. 

Starting with deep research, I bring all the essentials into one reader-friendly material, catering to a company's business needs. 

As a result-driven specialist, I am adept at delivering the production of meaningful and original content to fulfill brand awareness and draw quality leads.

