Moreinfo:
Over the course of 7+ years, I have managed to gain deep knowledge and experience in Business development. Aside from that my main focus through that time was building my Business Analysis skills. I have participated in many projects that dealt with a need to conceptualize the business idea and align it with the given reality.  
Starting projects, holding brainstorm and workshop sessions, collaborating with other people on the lean canvases – is what I love to do. 
Therefore, all in all, I am out there seeking for new opportunities and projects where I can put my knowledge/experience to great use. 

