candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst, System analyst

Moreinfo:
1 year of experience as a manual QA for market compliance software
- Requirements analysis; 
- Preparing test documentation;
- Performing functional/ non-functional test of the web application;
- Supporting the customer after product delivery.

2 years of experience as a business/ system analyst. Leasing and cash loan systems
- Analysing requirements, preparing documentation for the developers regarding the business needs;
- Process improvements;
- Analysing the current process, preparing the UML diagrams based on it;
- Providing the communication between dev team and the customer’s side;
- Performing acceptance testing.

Looking For:
I have the experience to work in a product company and I also have experience to work in an enterprise, both environments are suitable for me, as long as the process is stable. I prefer to work with agile methodology, but of course, it depends on the project and software we're building.

Highlights:
I was a part of a team which was working on banks merge, implementing new functionalities during a quite limited period of time. The project I was participating in, was one of the most important for the business (cash loans/ credit cards/ limit top-ups). Our team showed high efficiency and 90% of a backlog was implemented on time and with minimum amount of bugs in the product environment.

