candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst with technical background

Moreinfo:
Software engineer with 6 years of experience working on diverse projects involving web development, WinAPI, and ERP systems. 
Now seeking a transition to leveraging expertise in working with people and requirements. 
Fluent in English, adept at direct communication with customers and stakeholders to collaboratively define and refine requirements. 
Also successfully delivered customer technical support and mentored junior developers. 


    ERP (SQL, UX, C#, JavaScript, technical documentation, JIRA, Confluence).
    software distribution system development and maintenance, preprocessing tools (C++, Multithreading, WinAPI, XML, Remote Debugging, VMWare Workstation);
    automated installers generation (INI, Python, NSIS);
    event tracking web dashboard (REST, JS, PHP, Python, PostgreSQL, ETL, MySQL).
    crawlers, parsers, report generation tools (C++, Qt, boost, Redis);
    mentoring and managing two junior developers;
    customer websites optimization via FTP and various CMS;
    customer technical support, guidance with hosting and domain management, websites modifications upon customer requests.

pet projects:

    watercolor pigments mixing and palette picking tool, image segmentation, interpolation (C++, OpenCV, SQLite) and web visualization in HSV and RGB color spaces tool for debugging (JS, PHP, JSON);
    automation of knit socks pattern generation (JS, PHP, MySQL);
    source code symbols frequency analysis and combinations extraction for touch typing training lessons (Python, CSV);
    online game bots adjustments and localizations (Python, JS);
    3D modeling: cityscapes for references (SketchUp);
    construction engineering and 3D for renovation: design and implementation of drywall construction frames, wiring and piping layouts, and furniture design (SketchUp);
    automation of vector images creation (JS, Adobe Illustrator);
    compositing: pirates figures sculpting (wire rigging, polymer clay, fabric), ship flags painting (cotton, batik, sewing).

English Level:
fluent

Experience Years:
1.0

