candidate_profile:
Position:
COO, Senior Operations Manager, Senior Finance Manager

Moreinfo:
Operations:
• Aiding CEO to develop and implement strategic decisions; 
• Facilitating organizational change aimed at leveling up the quality of service; 
• Creating and monitoring control environment in a company; 
• Identifying, analyzing, describing and optimizing company processes and implementing a relevant software solution for managing them (BAS); 
• Detecting and addressing operational inefficiencies; 
• Developing and maintaining a system of policies and procedures, SOPs, SLAs for key operations and interactions; 
• Supervising daily operations of the company's departments, monitoring P&Ps compliance, facilitating intra-company cooperation and teamwork;
• Aiding logistical and warehouse operations improvements, working through existing and possible suppliers, negotiating terms of cooperation; 
• Establishing and maintaining an environment that promotes company culture and vision; 

Finance:
• Full relaunch of the finance function in a company;  
• Developing budget and financial model; 
• Developing financial framework for projects; 
• Financial and administrative support of international construction projects abroad; 
• Full coordination and support of closing down unfeasible construction projects and\or related companies;  
• Negotiating financial terms and conditions with contractors;  
• Creating and implementing budget controls and managerial reporting; 
• Organizing and leading budgeting and continuous re-forecasting processes; 
• Setting up key financial and operational controls; 
• Setting up and controlling the development of treasury function; 
• Taking part in the development of accounting policies and tax planning; 
• Facilitating and guiding the implementation of financial software (1C, BAS ERP)

Looking For:
Especially interested in improvements projects.
Not scared of deep calculations and analysis, multinational finance.
Data-driven management believer.

Highlights:
Fully re-set up finance function in a company.
Created a system of Policies and Procedures for a construction and maintenance company.
Ran teams on the side of the customer that started and finished successfully 3 projects of implementing financial software and 1 project of implementing process management software.

English Level:
fluent

Experience Years:
10.0

CV:
Fully re-set up finance function in a company.
Created a system of Policies and Procedures for a construction and maintenance company.
Ran teams on the side of the customer that started and finished successfully 3 projects of implementing financial software and 1 project of implementing process management software.
