Position:
Chief of Operations

Moreinfo:
Highly accomplished Chief of Operations with over 8 years of management experience within the IT, crypto, and grey niche industries. Proven record of accomplishment in successfully leading diverse teams of 100+ employees, delivering exceptional results, and managing a wide range of projects, including e-commerce, product, and service companies, mining, crypto, automotive, and marketing domains. Earned experience working closely with HR, marketing, development, sales, financial, research and design. Major experience achieved working within the United States. Ready for remote work options or the potential for relocation.

Highlights:
• Developed and implemented KPIs and metrics to track the performance of operational activities and company objectives, which increased employee satisfaction by 25%; 
• Managed hiring and successful integration of a team of over 170 employees for a customer project in 4 months; 
• Managed internal processes, organizational adaptation, and human administration activities that helped to successfully create processes for building outsourced teams to work with companies generating over $10 million in annual profits;
•	Successfully managed employee resources that helped to reduce company operational costs by 50% while generating the same revenues; 
• Implemented and managed OKRs throughout the company, which led to an increase in the motivation of the team and clear measurement of the company objectives and results. With OKRs, the team was able to reach new company goals in just 6 months which helped to generate over $2 million of annual income.

