I have experience in various fields: strategic planning, management, finance, human resources, recruiting, sales, marketing, service, public speaking. 

⇒ How can I help you with my experience:
∎ Develop / implement an operational strategy in accordance with the goals of the company and implement the tasks set within the agreed time frame;
∎ Create a team or departments from scratch and regulate their work in an office or remote format;
∎ Strengthen existing departments and processes, where there is room for growth, which will increase the efficiency of the company;
∎ Become an initiator of changes who will look at the company from a «helicopter view» mode and not just say, but make changes, that will help the team work more efficiently;
∎ Select suitable Digital tools for the working processes to make the lives of employees better and the company more efficient;
∎ Create motivation systems and criteria for monitoring the effectiveness of each of the departments (KPI / OKR).

I focus on the result, not the process, and make all my decisions based on three variables: experience, data and metrics.

My ideal company profile is people who create a sustainable product that gives value to humanity, who are similar to me in values, who want to develop and unite around a common goal. It’s a place where I can fully take responsibility and influence on the result.

If you are looking for a person who will increase the efficiency of your company and become its Harvey Specter from «Suits», write to me right now ;)
Challenging and interesting tasks, open management, friendly and professional team.

