Position:
Business Analyst - Agile & Scrum

Moreinfo:
A project manager with more than two year experience. 
Have experience in game development management, oil and gas industry management and a lot more.
I believe organized communication can solve every problem. I’m a big believer in structured communication, and try to incorporate it into both my personal and professional life. 
I hate wasting time. I’m always trying to trim down time requirements, hence why I’m keeping these points short.
I’m constantly learning new skills. For better or worse, this also includes skills outside my career as a project manager. I learn tricks in Excel, new leadership tactics, and better methods for communication, but I’m also learning how to code in my spare time, and am also learning to play piano despite no musical background whatsoever.

Skills:

- collection of requirements and data about the project;
- analysis and design of the project;
- writing technical documentation;
- risk assessment;
- setting goals for the team;
- tasking;
- control of quality and timing of projects.

