candidate_profile:
Position:
Business analyst

Moreinfo:
Business Analysis and Project management experience - 1+ years.
- Pre-Sales, discovery, proposals, vision creation and management; requirements gathering and management, game design; GDD, SRS; estimation, scoping and planning.
Product strategy and roadmap, Business, process, financial, product and data analysis; competitor, marketing researches and investigations.
Facilitate the definition of UX/UI approaches and prototyping;
Work on blockchain projects;
Project management up to 5 people and 3 projects simultaneously; people, resources, risk and time management. 
Frameworks, methodologies, principles, SDLC:
- Agile, Scrum, Waterfall and Iterative;
Technologies:
- Web based apps development;
- Unity & Unreal engines, AR\VR solutions for Mobile and PC, 2D/3D game modelling;
- JIRA, Confluence, MS Project, Redmine, UML tools, Visio;

Highlights:
I run a business analysis department, work in the pre-sales phase, pre-production phase, do evaluation, create roadmaps and proposals. I prepare projects for launch, communicate with the customers and development team, plan development, create Gantt charts. Writing project documentation (SRS, GDD). I create mockups and Wireframes for projects, on the basis of which UI/UX designers create prototypes. I have extensive experience in VR/AR/MR direction. I have experience with 3D engines (Unity/ Unreal). I have experience with web projects, marketplaces, configurators and web engines (Canvas/ PlayCanvas). I have experience with blockchain projects, currently developing blockchain direction and participating in two blockchain NFT projects.

