Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
- 6 years of experience in Logistics, Health Care, FinTech, and Insurance domains.
- Acted as a Business Analyst, Lead Business Analyst, Proxy Product Owner, and Product Owner.

Work experience:
- Presale activities: discoveries, solution proposals, etc.; 
   - Started projects from scratch;
- Communication with customers (including C-level): interview, questionnaire, workshop;
- Investigation and automation of business processes;
- Functional, and non-functional requirements elicitation and management;
- Roadmapping and prioritizing;
- Product/sprint backlog management (Confluence/JIRA): user stories, use case scenarios;
- Creating product and project documentation: Software Requirements Specification, Vision&Scope, Request for Proposal, Proposal for Development, Release Notes, User Guides, etc.;
- Web/mobile UI/UX prototyping (Axure, Balsamiq, Figma) from scratch; 
- UML, BPMN Modeling (LucidChart, DrawIO);
- Meetings facilitation; 
- Project troubleshooting;
- Full team support during the SDLC;
- Peopleware activities: hiring process, mentorship.

Looking For:
Preferences: 
- challenging projects where I can apply my experience and professional skills to build an easy yet convenient user experience;
