- elicit and document requirements (user stories with acceptance criteria, use cases);
- product documentation (Jira&Confluence);
- discovery phase;
- project vision and scope doc;
- prototyping (wireframes and mock-ups);
- agile methodologies (scrum/kanban).

Looking For:
As a motivated BA, I am looking for an interesting project to contribute my knowledge to set the smooth development process and create the perfect product.

